# Watermark Remover Bot

A free Telegram bot that removes watermarks from images using AI.

## Features
- 100% free to use
- Removes text watermarks, logos, and stamps
- No signup required
- Simple, clean UI

## How to Use
1. Send `/start` to the bot
2. Send any photo with a watermark
3. Receive the cleaned image

## Deployment
1. Push to GitHub
2. Create Web Service on Render
3. Set `BOT_TOKEN` and `PORT=10000` environment variables
4. Deploy

## Tech Stack
- Node.js
- Telegraf
- Gradio Client (Hugging Face)
- SQLite
- Express
